%% Current state. Sources: API handlers, verification stack, DATA-MODEL.md. Verified 2026-09-13.
flowchart TD
  Start[Create/resume application] --> Details[Personal, contact, address, name and identity data]
  Details --> Payment[Customer payment or reserved business credit]
  Payment --> Evidence[Upload documents; liveness mobile handoff when used]
  Evidence --> PreUpload[Upload-time OCR/metadata, Rekognition hints, liveness result]
  PreUpload --> Consent[Consent and submission prerequisites]
  Consent --> Submit[Submit API writes SUBMITTED]
  Submit --> SQS[Submission SQS] --> Trigger[workflow-trigger] --> Workflow[Verification workflow]
  Workflow -->|NEEDS_REVIEW / error| Review[Manual review notification and admin operations]
  Workflow -->|NDCO / non-DCO| Certificate[Certificate generation and delivery]
  Workflow -->|DCO| Window[Dispute window: hold certificate/external delivery]
  Window --> Close[Waive, sweep expiry, withdrawal, or admin resolution]
  Close --> Certificate
  Certificate --> Retention[DynamoDB TTL and S3 lifecycle / cleanup]
  style Workflow fill:#6C5CE7,color:#fff
  style Review fill:#D63031,color:#fff
  style Certificate fill:#00B894,color:#fff
